 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.1+8 — 2026-08-19
+
+### Corrected
+
+- Restores the intended Roboto/Material typography on the standalone Strength Program and Athletic Functional Training routes.
+- Removes Flutter's red fallback text and yellow double-underlines by giving branded route surfaces a Material text-style boundary.
+- Keeps standalone Strength, Athletic, and Progress screens clear of the Android status and navigation bars.
+- Adds regression coverage for Material ancestry on directly routed program screens.
+
